  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether-protect-your-moa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/Protect-Your-Moa/blob/1.19.4-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=7289DA&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/twitter-@DevAether-lightgrey?style=flat-square&amp;logo=twitter&amp;color=1DA1F2&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmastodon.gamedev.place%252f%2540DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/mastodon/follow/110581810287361848?domain=https://mastodon.gamedev.place/&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logo=mastodon&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=mastodon&amp;color=858AFA\" alt=\"Mastodon\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&amp;logoSource=feather&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=1877F2&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&amp;label=instagram&amp;logo=instagram&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&amp;label=tiktok&amp;logo=tiktok&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&amp;label=youtube&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&amp;label=reddit&amp;logo=reddit&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🛡️ 關於此擴充模組 🛡️<br></strong></span></h2><p>「保護你的莫亞」擴充模組為莫亞探索增添了新玩法。玩家可製作<strong>莫亞護甲</strong>來提升莫亞防護力，例如重力石莫亞護甲還能提供額外跳躍能力。此外還能為莫亞裝備<strong>儲物箱</strong>，讓牠們成為移動倉庫。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/b65b3a3a53985b0cdf10bc1cb6c3728f5ffbf638/images/protectYourMoa0.png\" width=\"1167\" height=\"402\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 天界團隊其他作品 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>若對本模組有疑問，或想了解天界團隊其他開發計畫，歡迎加入我們的Discord社群！親切的團隊成員與友善社群將讓您賓至如歸！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>您也可透過Patreon贊助支持天界團隊！所有贊助將直接投入開發，讓我們能持續創作熱愛的專案。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
